ntrace-art:py-4 cursor-pointer uppercase break-words">Learn more</a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex w-full flex-col flex-2"><div class="overflow-x-clip"><div class="py-12 lg:py-40"><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[920px] p-6 md:p-[7rem] lg:px-[10rem] xl:p-16 2xl:px-[7rem]"><div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-[600px] before:absolute before:left-4 before:top-4 before:h-full before:w-full before:bg-[#71c5e8] before:content-[&#x27;&#x27;]"><img class="relative z-[1] aspect-[3/2] object-cover" src="https://www.ice.com/publicdocs/images/ICE-homepage-mortgage-tech-01.jpg" alt="https://www.ice.com/publicdocs/images/ICE-homepage-mortgage-tech-01.jpg"/></div><span class="absolute left-[-2%] top-[-5%] hidden w-[40%] md:block z-[1]" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><span class="absolute right-0 top-0 -z-[1] -m-5 h-10 w-10 border-2 border-black"></span><img src="https://www.ice.com/publicdocs/images/ICE-homepage-mortgage-tech-02.jpg" alt="https://www.ice.com/publicdocs/images/ICE-homepage-mortgage-tech-02.jpg" class="aspect-[5/3] object-cover"/></span><span class="absolute bottom-[-5%] left-[-8%] hidden w-[30%] md:block z-[1]" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)"><span class="absolute left-full top-full -z-[1] -m-5 h-10 w-1/2 border-2 border-black"></span><img src="https://www.ice.com/publicdocs/images/ICE-homepage-mortgage-tech-03.jpg" alt="https://www.ice.com/publicdocs/images/ICE-homepage-mortgage-tech-03.jpg" class="aspect-[4/3] object-cover"/></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="energy" class="relative bg-cover bg-center even:bg-gray-100 px-6 py-16 sm:py-24 md:py-32 lg:py-40" style="background-image:url(https://www.ice.com/publicdocs/images/ICE-homepage-energy-01.jpg)"><div id="integration-id-3b3b468" data-testid="belt" class="mx-auto w-full sm:w-[540px] md:w-[720px] lg:w-[960px] xl:w-[1140px] 2xl:w-[1320px]"><div class="flex gap-6 sm:gap-8 md:gap-10 lg:gap-12 xl:gap-14 2xl:gap-16 items-center lg:flex-ro